contentText:
Música mexicana singer Majo Aguilar has signed an exclusive worldwide publishing agreement with Universal Music Publishing Group (UMPG) Mexico, Billboard can announce exclusively on Thursday (July 9).

&#8220;I&#8217;m so excited for this new chapter with Universal Music Publishing Group Mexico, one of creativity and companionship, where I&#8217;ll continue creating alongside such talented songwriters and a wonderful team,&#8221; Aguilar said in a statement. &#8220;I can&#8217;t wait for all the beautiful things ahead.&#8221;

